      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1360739066,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "WHY TWO SYSTEMS?\n\nk3s: only Kubernetes\ncan use HAMi to give\na pod a part of the\nGPU's memory.\n\nCompose: our own\nservices need no GPU\nand are simpler to\nrestart and rebuild.",
