      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "WRONG ANSWER TO OVERLOAD\n\n\"Add another replica on the same GPU.\"\nSame compute, less KV for each worker,\nmore hops.\n\nOurs: raise the engine's running cap while\ntime per token holds, then more GPU compute\n(a second physical GPU).",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "WRONG ANSWER TO OVERLOAD\n\n\"Add another replica on the same GPU.\"\nSame compute, less KV for each worker,\nmore hops.\n\nOurs: raise the engine's running cap while\ntime per token holds, then more GPU compute\n(a second physical GPU).",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    }
